<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$328,000 Arizona tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat 3-Carlos Moya (Spain) 7-6 (10-8)</p>
<p>5-7 6-3</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat 4-Albert Costa (Spain) 6-4 2-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>8-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
</text>
